  "ibr-sr-58": ["Add cbc:ID (ibt-151, VAT category code: S, Z, E, O, AE or N) in cac:Item/cac:ClassifiedTaxCategory.","Aggiungi cbc:ID (ibt-151, codice categoria IVA: S, Z, E, O, AE o N) in cac:Item/cac:ClassifiedTaxCategory."],
